EXPERIMENT 1 – UIPATH STUDIO FAMILIARIZATION
============================================================

AIM:
To explore the UiPath Studio interface and create, save, and execute a basic automation workflow using Sequence, variables, Assign activities, and a Message Box activity.

PROCEDURE:
1. Open UiPath Studio and sign in using a UiPath account.
2. Create a new Process project named FirstAutomation.
3. Select the appropriate Windows compatibility and expression language options.
4. Open Main.xaml and add a Sequence activity.
5. Rename the Sequence as Student Welcome Automation.
6. Create two String variables named studentName and courseName.
7. Add an Assign activity and assign "Student" to studentName.
8. Add another Assign activity and assign "Robotic Process Automation Lab" to courseName.
9. Add a Message Box activity after the Assign activities.
10. Enter the expression:
    "Welcome " + studentName + " to the " + courseName + "."
11. Set the Message Box title to Welcome Message.
12. Save, validate, and run the workflow. Verify the displayed message.

FLOW CHART:
[START] -> [Open UiPath Studio] -> [Create FirstAutomation Project]
   -> [Add Sequence] -> [Create String Variables]
   -> [Assign studentName] -> [Assign courseName]
   -> [Add Message Box] -> [Display Welcome Message] -> [END]


