EXPERIMENT 3 – EMAIL AUTOMATION
============================================================

AIM:
To automate an email-related task in UiPath by preparing and sending an email message using the configured email integration.

PROCEDURE:
1. Open UiPath Studio and create a Process project named EmailAutomation.
2. Add a Sequence activity named Send Email.
3. Check whether the required email activity package or integration is installed.
