EXPERIMENT 4 – EXCEL/PDF AUTOMATION
============================================================

AIM:
To automate reading and writing data in an Excel workbook and extracting or processing text from a PDF document using UiPath activities.

PROCEDURE:
1. Create a Process project named ExcelPdfAutomation.
2. Open Main.xaml.
3. Prepare a sample Excel workbook and a text-based PDF file.
4. Add a Sequence activity named Excel and PDF Processing.
5. Add an Excel file activity to open the workbook.
6. Use Read Range to read the required Excel data into a DataTable variable.
7. Use For Each Row in Data Table to process selected rows or values.
8. Use Write Range to write the processed data into an output workbook.
9. Add the appropriate PDF text extraction activity.
10. Specify the input PDF file path.
11. Store the extracted PDF text in a String variable.
12. Use Message Box, Log Message, or a file-writing activity to verify the extracted text.
13. Save, validate, and run the workflow.
14. Open the output workbook and verify the extracted PDF text.

FLOW CHART:
[START] -> [Create ExcelPdfAutomation Project] -> [Add Sequence]
   -> [Open Excel Workbook] -> [Read Range]
   -> [Store Data in DataTable] -> [For Each Row in DataTable]
   -> [Process Excel Data] -> [Write Range to Output Excel]
   -> [Specify PDF File Path] -> [Extract PDF Text]
   -> [Store Text in String Variable] -> [Display Extracted Text]
   -> [Verify Output] -> [END]


